# UI Title Case

Use **Title Case** for:

- Page titles and section headings (e.g. "Test Results", "Deployment Status")
- Table column headers
- Navigation labels

Use **sentence case** for helper text, tooltips, and long descriptions.

Button labels: verb-first where actionable ("Refresh Data", "View Pipeline").

See [`docs/implemented-design/design/ui-controls.md`](../../docs/implemented-design/design/ui-controls.md).
